@startuml
title Cleanux — AS-IS State Architecture
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "AppState" {
  rectangle "data: DataState" {
    rectangle "repository_service: Arc<RepositoryService>"
    rectangle "crud_service: Arc<CrudService>"
  }
}

note bottom of AppState
  All state registered via app.manage()
  Accessed via State<'_, AppState>
  RepositoryService backed by nosql_orm JSON provider
  Data stored in app_data_dir() as JSON files
end note

note top of AppState
  Tauri v2 State Management
  Single AppState with DataState containing persistence layer
end note
@enduml
